# General Context

The gaboesquivel NPM package is the structured fact source for Gabo Esquivel's projects and technology experience.

## Purpose

The package supplies project and technology data to gaboesquivel.com, the CLI, and the GitHub profile. The website owns page-level positioning and career narrative.

## Package Structure

The package exports project data, technology data, and query functions. Projects include titles, slugs, descriptions, technology tags, achievements, story records, links, and presentation metadata. Technology records describe practical experience and project associations.

## Usage

gaboesquivel.com consumes the exports for project cards, project pages, work listings, and technology pages. The CLI is available through `npx gaboesquivel`.

## Development Guidelines

Maintain factual accuracy and consistent slugs, tags, dates, and relationships. Use the writer skill for project copy. Do not add site narrative, invent facts, or describe this package as a source of CV landing-page prose.
